      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike transport by train in India?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For bike transport by train in India, you typically need to provide the original registration certificate of the bike, a valid ID proof, and a copy of the insurance policy. Additionally, you may need to fill out a parcel booking form at the railway station.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the bike parcel process work with Indian Railways?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The bike parcel process with Indian Railways involves booking your bike at the parcel office, paying the applicable charges, and receiving a receipt. Your bike will be securely loaded onto the train, and you can track its status until it reaches the destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken during bike transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">During bike transport, Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers employs a 7-layer shock-absorbent packaging system, including heavy-duty bubble wrap and custom wooden crates. Additionally, bikes are secured in specialized carriers with hydraulic ramps to prevent movement and damage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any additional charges for bike transport in Katraj?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Additional charges for bike transport in Katraj may apply based on distance, type of bike, and any extra services requested, such as insurance or specialized packaging. It’s best to obtain a detailed quote to understand all potential costs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers provides satellite GPS live tracking for all bike transport services. Customers can monitor the location of their bike in real-time, ensuring peace of mind during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I do if my bike is damaged during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">In the unlikely event of damage during transport, customers should immediately report the issue to Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers. With full transit insurance, claims can be filed to cover repair costs, ensuring you are compensated for any damages.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does bike transport from Katraj to other cities take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The duration of bike transport from Katraj to other cities varies based on distance and route. Typically, it can take anywhere from 2 to 7 days. Fast express schedules are available for timely delivery, ensuring your bike reaches its destination promptly.</p>
